# RAVEN-OTA Backend Implementation Plan

## Goal
Build a complete FastAPI backend (14 phases) that powers the existing React frontend with deterministic runtime assurance logic — no LLM safety decisions, no hardcoded research results.

## Existing Frontend Contract

The frontend at `a:\RAVEN\raven-ota-ui` expects these data shapes (from [`src/types/index.ts`](file:///a:/RAVEN/raven-ota-ui/src/types/index.ts)):

| Type | Key Fields |
|------|-----------|
| `Vehicle` | id, model, softwareVersion, assuranceState, envelopeMargin, dominantConstraint, context, currentTelemetry, margins[], prediction, activeMitigation |
| `OTAUpdate` | id, version, releaseDate, type, status, rolloutPercentage, targetVehicles, verificationArtifactId |
| `VerificationArtifact` | id, otaId, hashDigest, signatureValidity, asilLevel, formalInvariant |
| `SafetyEnvelope` | id, artifactRef, maxCpuUtilization, maxCanBusLoad, maxTaskJitter, maxEcuTemp, temporalBoundaries |
| `Incident` | id, timestamp, vehicleId, otaVersion, severity, constraintViolated, mitigationAction, resolved |
| `EvidenceRecord` | incidentId, vehicleId, softwareVersion, verificationArtifact, safetyEnvelope, telemetry[], context, margins[], prediction, assuranceDecision, response, postResponseVerification, evidenceChain[] |
| `SimulationScenario` | id, name, description, category |

The backend API responses **must match these shapes** so the frontend works with minimal changes.

