#### Phase 3 — Telemetry + Context + Margin Engine

##### [NEW] `backend/app/models/telemetry.py`, `context.py`
##### [NEW] `backend/app/schemas/telemetry.py`, `context.py`, `assurance.py`
##### [NEW] `backend/app/services/telemetry_service.py`, `context_service.py`
##### [NEW] `backend/app/algorithms/margin_engine.py`

Margin formula: `margin = (limit - observed) / limit`

Severity classification:
- `margin > 15%` → NORMAL
- `5% < margin ≤ 15%` → NEAR_BOUNDARY (maps to WARNING)
- `margin ≤ 5%` → VIOLATION (maps to DEGRADED/UNSAFE)

##### [NEW] `backend/app/api/routes/telemetry.py`, `assurance.py`

**Verification**: POST telemetry, GET margins, verify correct margin calculations.

